WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:26.920
Morning!

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:27.760
Morning!

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.800
Hey, get back to work!

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.000
Hey Mom!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.060
Stop it! Ick! Ugh!

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:51.240
Blazey, down!

