00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.140
Nope, it's garbage for the trash can...

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:13.860
and you left the lid off!

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.080
Aaah, shoo!
Get out of here!

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.200
Shoo! Get!
Ugh, gross!

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.440
Ugh, unicorns.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:32.280
We are going on a grand and glorious quest.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.240
It's not a quest.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:35.440
It's just a really fast and strange errand.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.120
It's totally a quest.

